# Conventional Commits (https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) are used:
#   feat: | fix: | refactor: | perf: | test: | docs: | chore:
#
# Commit message format:
#   <type>(<optional scope>): <short imperative summary>
#
#   Body explaining WHY the change is needed (not just what changed).
#   Footer with references to issues/PRs when applicable.
